# AWS S3 Bucket Data Migration & Sync with Terraform

## Project Overview
This repository contains a production-grade Infrastructure as Code (IaC) solution built using **Terraform** to automate cloud infrastructure provisioning and secure object data migration between AWS S3 buckets. Designed as part of an enterprise data migration pipeline, this implementation ensures idempotent resource deployment, strict access control governance, and complete data consistency.

---

## Architecture & Technical Stack

* **Infrastructure as Code:** Terraform (`v1.x`)
* **Cloud Provider:** Amazon Web Services (AWS)
* **Core Services:** Amazon S3, AWS IAM, S3 Ownership Controls, S3 ACLs
* **Automation & Provisioning:** `null_resource` with `local-exec` provisioner leveraging the **AWS CLI** (`aws s3 sync`)

